            "id": 82607,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo podemos reutilizar el valor dado por <code>max(jeans_sizes)</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"jeans_sizes = [\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"28\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max(jeans_sizes)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Guardando el resultado de <code>max(jeans_sizes)</code> en una variable</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No podemos reutilizar el valor, solo podemos mostrarlo una vez</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Guardando el resultado de <code>max(jeans_sizes)</code> en una variable.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos reutilizar el valor de <code>max(jeans_sizes)</code> guardando su resultado en una variable.</p><p>¿Qué línea reemplaza la última y almacena el resultado en <code>largest_size</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"jeans_sizes = [\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"28\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max(jeans_sizes)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>largest_size = max(jeans_sizes)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>largest_size == max(jeans_sizes)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>largest_size = jeans_sizes</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>largest_size = max(jeans_sizes)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
