            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Encuentra la temperatura más alta de los últimos tres días con <code>max()</code>, en la lista <code>temperatures</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"68\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"81\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max(temperatures))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"81\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>max</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>temperatures</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La lista <code>temperatures</code> contiene los últimos tres días. Haz que el código muestre la temperatura más alta, <code>81</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"68\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"81\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max(temperatures))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"68\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"81\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>max</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>temperatures</code> y finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
